 soul-sucking communists, violent black bloc and the DNC/Media machine who enable them.\n\nNearly 2 weeks after the election, what has changed? has Trump finally gotten more aggressive? Eh no. Miller is in charge of staff. that's cool but Trump signaled he'd support Amnesty (By other names).Instead of just doubling down and FINALLY embarassing the useless GOP guys. The operative lesson here is to BE AGGRESSIVE. Even to your own party. Trump never showed that toward the worst elements of the GOP and even became their friends.\n\nThe \"Dissident right\" may be homeless for a while as the Trump era fizzles to a sad and mediocre conclusion. Will MAGA find a new champion? Will that champion be legitimate? May God have mercy on our souls.", "author": "AmannamedRJ", "created": 1794798548097, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "greatpumpkin", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "The ultimate lesson from the midterms", "last_comment_created": 1794802933527, "content": "<p>You cannot be a &quot;great disruptor&quot; and a great &quot;appeaser&quot; then play the same old politics. Most of Trump's &quot;allies&quot; threw him and his mandate under the bus. The voters wanted Trump the disruptor. We got Trump the appeaser. The cope we got was that the system is slow and somehow demands negotiation with &quot;our own side&quot; (The GOP). &quot;But it's negotiation,&quot; they say, &quot;The Art of the Deal&quot; followed by a misused from 'Sun Soo's' book The Art of War about not stopping your enemy even though you totally should.</p>\n<p>This isn't real-estate. There is no deal with soul-sucking communists, violent black bloc and the DNC/Media machine who enable them.</p>\n<p>Nearly 2 weeks after the election, what has changed? has Trump finally gotten more aggressive? Eh no. Miller is in charge of staff. that's cool but Trump signaled he'd support Amnesty (By other names).Instead of just doubling down and FINALLY embarassing the useless GOP guys. The operative lesson here is to BE AGGRESSIVE. Even to your own party. Trump never showed that toward the worst elements of the GOP and even became their friends.</p>\n<p>The &quot;Dissident right&quot; may be homeless for a while as the Trump era fizzles to a sad and mediocre conclusion. Will MAGA find a new champion? Will that champion be legitimate? May God have mercy on our souls.</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 2, "score_up": 11, "is_edited": true, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "SAVE AMERICA", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1AToiHV8Md", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 129, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8940933, "raw_content": "", "author": "TheLawofOne-", "created": 1794750324666, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "45fan", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "media.scored.co", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://media.scored.co/post/tWmbO87AyWlx.jpeg", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Vaccines did not save us ", "last_comment_created": 1794780504040, "content": "", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": true, "comments": 14, "score_up": 129, "is_edited": false, "is